design\feature_descriptions\F_82_waitforinput_state_display.md:19:When a streaming-agent goes into 'WaitForInput' state, the card action button and buttons on the action popup should no longer show 'running' state, but 'waitForInput' state so that the user knows he needs to look at the card.
