design\feature_descriptions\F_76_action_streaming_or_oneshot_agent_mode.md:23:Multi-turn today is **faked**: each turn is a new process, continuity comes from `buildResumeAgentCommand` (`claude --resume <id>` / `codex exec resume --json <id>`) plus transcript replay through `contextInput`. So a conversation = sequence of one-shot processes. One process = one turn = one `assistant` message (`${runId}-assistant`).
