design\feature_descriptions\F_82_waitforinput_state_display.md:25:Live card state can still appear as running until conversation data refreshes because the button does not read `runningExecution.status`. `ActionPopup` reduces all active executions to `runningActionIds`; `ActionSelector` therefore shows a primary-colored running spinner and “Agent is running” for waiting actions.
